# Runtime: Hermes + Kiro

| Component | Role |
|-----------|------|
| **Hermes** (`hermes-gateway.service`) | 24/7 Telegram, skills, `/plan`, Kanban |
| **Kiro bridge** (`kiro-openai-bridge.service`, `127.0.0.1:8787`) | OpenAI-compatible backend for Hermes → `kiro-cli` |
| **Kiro CLI** | Primary coding agent in repo (`kiro-cli --agent aegis-orchestrator`) |

## Active services (user systemd)

```bash
systemctl --user status hermes-gateway kiro-openai-bridge
```

## Forbidden

- **Do not enable** `telegram-kiro-gateway.service` (bypasses bridge/Hivemind path)
- Legacy code lives under `tools/archive/telegram-kiro-gateway/` for reference only

## Smoke check

```bash
aegis-dev
# or: scripts/start-aegis-dev.sh
scripts/verify-hivemind-shared-memory.sh
```

Details: `docs/kit/07-memory-architecture.md`, `docs/kit/02-hermes-24-7.md`
